`s 186(1) and (3), s 78E(1)(c) the company must lodge a copy of the special resolution within 14 days after the passing` MEANS
    PARTY Company `the name of the company`
    MUST `s 186(1) and s 78E(1)(c) the company lodges a copy of the special resolution with the Registrar`
    WITHIN 14
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY Company `the name of the company` BECAUSE "the company did not lodge a copy of the special resolution with the Registrar within 14 days after the passing (s 186(1)); the company and every officer of the company who is in default are guilty of an offence (s 186(3)), and a private company's reduction does not take effect without the copy (s 78E(1)(c))"

